---
const steps = [
  {
    id: "welcome",
    title: "Making\nDecisions",
    description:
      "Decision making can be hard, but it doesn't have to be. By using this guide you can make decisions with confidence.",
    detail:
      "Structure your thoughts into manageable layers. Reduce cognitive load by focusing on one variable at a time.",
    action: "Let's get started!",
  },
  {
    id: "objective",
    eyebrow: "Step 1 of 4",
    title: "What are you trying to decide?",
    description:
      "This can be any question. Examples include:",
    detail: "",
    action: "Next",
    examples: ["Should I go on a trip?", "Should I change jobs?", "Can I retire?"],
    input: {
      label: "Example Question",
      placeholder: "Type your question here",
      value: "Should I have a call with Garth?",
    },
  },
  {
    id: "gains",
    eyebrow: "Step 2 of 5",
    title: "What is there to gain?",
    description:
      "If you go with this decision, what do you serve to gain from this, how can you benefit? Are these important to you?",
    detail: "",
    action: "Next",
    input: {
      label: "Example Gains",
      placeholder: "List what you could gain",
      value:
        "I can practice English\nEnglish will help me travel\nThis will increase my confidence\nI get more comfortable with Garth\nDiscover if I want more of Garth in my life",
    },
  },
  {
    id: "stakes",
    eyebrow: "Step 3 of 5",
    title: "What are the risks?",
    description:
      "What are the different possible things that can go wrong? What are all the risks? List them off here.",
    detail: "",
    action: "Next",
    input: {
      label: "Example Risks",
      placeholder: "List the risks here",
      value:
        "I’m not good with phone calls.\nI can’t use gestures.\nI can’t use a translator.\nI don’t know when to hang up.\nIt will feel simply embarrassing.",
    },
  },
  {
    id: "timeline",
    eyebrow: "Step 4 of 5",
    title: "And if you don't do this?",
    description:
      "If you didn't go ahead with the decision, what would happen? What would you be missing out on?",
    detail: "",
    action: "Next",
    input: {
      label: "Example Consequences",
      placeholder: "List what would happen if you do nothing",
      value:
        "I would miss out in connecting with Garth\nGarth might feel sad or hurt\nI would miss a chance to practice English\nI would miss a chance to improve my skills",
    },
  },
  {
    id: "mitigation",
    eyebrow: "Step 5 of 5",
    title: "How can we mitigate risk?",
    description:
      "Given the risks, what can be done to minimize these? Risks can always be mitigated.",
    detail: "",
    action: "Next",
    input: {
      label: "Example Mitigations",
      placeholder: "List what could reduce the risks",
      value:
        "Explain that I feel embarrsed\nUse a video call for gestures\nType in Japanese in chat at the same time\nLearn the phrase \"I should go\"",
    },
  },
  {
    id: "conclusion",
    eyebrow: "Conclusion",
    title: "Conclusion",
    description:
      "If the gains are worth it - then minimize the risk.",
    detail:
      "Always remember the cost of not doing something or delaying something, it sometimes has a bigger impact of the risk itself.",
    action: "Start Over",
  },
];
---

<section class="decision-app" data-decision-app data-steps={JSON.stringify(steps)}>
  <main class="app-main">
    <section class="screen screen-welcome is-active" data-screen="welcome" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="hero-mark"></div>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1>Making<br />Decisions</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Decision making can be hard, but it doesn't have to be. By using this guide you
          can make decisions with confidence.
        </p>
        <p class="supporting-intro">
          This process can be applied to almost any decsion, both large and small.
        </p>
        <p class="supporting-intro">
          For now, we will walk through an example scenario together. Later, you will be
          able to use the same process for your own real decisions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="screen screen-question" data-screen="question" hidden>
      <div class="screen-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-eyebrow></p>
        <h2 data-title></h2>
        <p class="lede" data-description></p>
        <ul class="example-list" data-examples hidden></ul>
      </div>

      <div class="question-panel">
        <p class="supporting-copy" data-detail></p>
        <label class="editorial-input" data-input-wrap hidden>
          <span class="input-label" data-input-label></span>
          <div class="editorial-input-surface">
            <textarea
              rows="5"
              data-input
            ></textarea>
            <div class="editorial-input-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
        </label>
        <div class="option-list" data-options></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="screen screen-summary" data-screen="summary" hidden>
      <div class="screen-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Conclusion</p>
        <h2>Conclusion</h2>
        <p class="lede">If the gains are worth it - then minimize the risk.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="summary-panel">
        <div class="summary-card">
          <span class="summary-label">If you don't do this</span>
          <p data-summary-timeline></p>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-card">
          <span class="summary-label">Risks</span>
          <p data-summary-stakes></p>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-note summary-question">
          Of the two, which is the worst outcome?
        </div>
        <div class="summary-note">
          Always remember the cost of not doing something or delaying something, it
          sometimes has a bigger impact of the risk itself.
        </div>
        <div class="summary-note">
          The more you de-risk the situation, the more comfortable you will be with the
          decison you make.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="bottom-bar">
    <div class="bottom-shell">
      <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-back hidden>Back</button>
      <div class="progress" aria-label="Progress" data-progress></div>
      <button class="primary-action" type="button" data-next>
        <span data-next-label>Let's get started!</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
  const root = document.querySelector("[data-decision-app]");

  if (root) {
    const steps = JSON.parse(root.dataset.steps || "[]");
    const questionScreen = root.querySelector('[data-screen="question"]');
    const summaryScreen = root.querySelector('[data-screen="summary"]');
    const welcomeScreen = root.querySelector('[data-screen="welcome"]');
    const nextButton = root.querySelector("[data-next]");
    const backButton = root.querySelector("[data-back]");
    const nextLabel = root.querySelector("[data-next-label]");
    const progress = root.querySelector("[data-progress]");
    const title = root.querySelector("[data-title]");
    const eyebrow = root.querySelector("[data-eyebrow]");
    const description = root.querySelector("[data-description]");
    const detail = root.querySelector("[data-detail]");
    const examplesHost = root.querySelector("[data-examples]");
    const inputWrap = root.querySelector("[data-input-wrap]");
    const inputLabel = root.querySelector("[data-input-label]");
    const inputField = root.querySelector("[data-input]");
    const optionsHost = root.querySelector("[data-options]");
    const questionPanel = root.querySelector(".question-panel");

    const state = {
      index: 0,
      selections: {},
    };

    for (const step of steps) {
      if (step.input?.value && !state.selections[step.id]) {
        state.selections[step.id] = step.input.value;
      }
    }

    function getStepIndexFromUrl() {
      const url = new URL(window.location.href);
      const stepId = url.searchParams.get("step");

      if (!stepId) return 0;

      const foundIndex = steps.findIndex((step) => step.id === stepId);
      return foundIndex >= 0 ? foundIndex : 0;
    }

    function syncUrl(replace = false) {
      const step = steps[state.index];

      if (!step) return;

      const url = new URL(window.location.href);

      if (step.id === "welcome") {
        url.searchParams.delete("step");
      } else {
        url.searchParams.set("step", step.id);
      }

      const nextUrl = `${url.pathname}${url.search}${url.hash}`;
      const method = replace ? "replaceState" : "pushState";
      window.history[method]({ step: step.id }, "", nextUrl);
    }

    const questionStepIds = steps
      .filter((step) => Array.isArray(step.options) || step.input)
      .map((step) => step.id);

    function renderProgress() {
      if (!progress) return;

      const dots = steps.map((step, index) => {
        const active = index === state.index ? "is-active" : "";
        const complete = index < state.index ? "is-complete" : "";
        return `<span class="progress-dot ${active} ${complete}" aria-hidden="true"></span>`;
      });

      progress.innerHTML = dots.join("");
    }

    function renderQuestion(step) {
      if (!questionScreen || !optionsHost || !title || !eyebrow || !description || !detail) {
        return;
      }

      eyebrow.textContent = step.eyebrow;
      title.textContent = step.title;
      description.textContent = step.description;
      detail.textContent = step.detail;

      if (examplesHost) {
        const hasExamples = Array.isArray(step.examples) && step.examples.length > 0;
        examplesHost.hidden = !hasExamples;
        examplesHost.innerHTML = hasExamples
          ? step.examples.map((example) => `<li>${example}</li>`).join("")
          : "";
      }

      if (inputWrap && inputField && inputLabel) {
        const hasInput = Boolean(step.input);
        inputWrap.hidden = !hasInput;
        questionPanel?.classList.toggle("question-panel-input", hasInput);

        if (hasInput) {
          inputLabel.textContent = step.input.label || "";
          inputField.placeholder = step.input.placeholder || "";
          inputField.value = state.selections[step.id] || step.input.value || "";
        } else {
          inputField.value = "";
        }
      }

      const selectedValue = state.selections[step.id];
      const hasOptions = Array.isArray(step.options) && step.options.length > 0;
      optionsHost.hidden = !hasOptions;
      optionsHost.innerHTML = (step.options || [])
        .map((option, index) => {
          const isSelected = selectedValue === option.label;
          return `
            <button
              class="option-card ${isSelected ? "is-selected" : ""}"
              type="button"
              data-option
              data-step="${step.id}"
              data-value="${option.label}"
              aria-pressed="${isSelected ? "true" : "false"}"
            >
              <span class="option-index">0${index + 1}</span>
              <span class="option-copy">
                <strong>${option.label}</strong>
                <span>${option.description}</span>
              </span>
            </button>
          `;
        })
        .join("");
    }

    function renderSummary() {
      const stakes = root.querySelector("[data-summary-stakes]");
      const timeline = root.querySelector("[data-summary-timeline]");

      if (stakes) {
        stakes.textContent = state.selections.stakes || "Not selected";
      }

      if (timeline) {
        timeline.textContent = state.selections.timeline || "Not selected";
      }
    }

    function syncScreens() {
      const step = steps[state.index];
      const isWelcome = step.id === "welcome";
      const isSummary = step.id === "conclusion";

      if (welcomeScreen) {
        welcomeScreen.hidden = !isWelcome;
        welcomeScreen.classList.toggle("is-active", isWelcome);
      }

      if (questionScreen) {
        questionScreen.hidden = isWelcome || isSummary;
        questionScreen.classList.toggle("is-active", !isWelcome && !isSummary);
      }

      if (summaryScreen) {
        summaryScreen.hidden = !isSummary;
        summaryScreen.classList.toggle("is-active", isSummary);
      }

      if (!isWelcome && !isSummary) {
        renderQuestion(step);
      }

      if (isSummary) {
        renderSummary();
      }

      if (nextLabel) {
        nextLabel.textContent = step.action;
      }

      if (backButton) {
        backButton.hidden = state.index === 0;
      }

      if (nextButton) {
        const requiresChoice = Array.isArray(step.options) && questionStepIds.includes(step.id);
        nextButton.disabled = requiresChoice && !state.selections[step.id];
      }

      renderProgress();
    }

    root.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      const option = event.target.closest("[data-option]");
      if (option) {
        const stepId = option.dataset.step;
        const value = option.dataset.value;

        if (stepId && value) {
          state.selections[stepId] = value;
          syncScreens();
        }
      }
    });

    inputField?.addEventListener("input", (event) => {
      const step = steps[state.index];

      if (!step?.input) return;

      state.selections[step.id] = event.target.value;
      syncScreens();
    });

    nextButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      if (state.index === steps.length - 1) {
        state.index = 0;
        state.selections = {};
        syncUrl();
        syncScreens();
        return;
      }

      state.index += 1;
      syncUrl();
      syncScreens();
    });

    backButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      state.index = Math.max(0, state.index - 1);
      syncUrl();
      syncScreens();
    });

    window.addEventListener("popstate", () => {
      state.index = getStepIndexFromUrl();
      syncScreens();
    });

    state.index = getStepIndexFromUrl();
    syncUrl(true);
    syncScreens();
  }
</script>

<style>
  :global(:root) {
    color-scheme: light;
    --surface: #f8faf9;
    --surface-bright: #fbfcfb;
    --surface-low: #f1f4f3;
    --surface-high: #e4e9e8;
    --surface-highest: #dde4e3;
    --surface-ghost: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.85);
    --surface-shadow: rgb(45 52 51 / 0.06);
    --text: #2d3433;
    --text-soft: #596060;
    --text-muted: #555d59;
    --primary: #4c645a;
    --primary-dim: #40584e;
    --primary-container: #cde9db;
    --primary-ink: #3f574d;
    --outline-soft: rgb(117 124 123 / 0.16);
    --font-display: "Manrope", "Avenir Next", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    --font-body: "Manrope", "Avenir Next", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    --font-label: "Inter", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
    --ease-calm: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    --radius-default: 0.125rem;
    --radius-lg: 0.25rem;
    --radius-xl: 0.5rem;
    --radius-full: 0.75rem;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100svh;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgb(205 233 219 / 0.55), transparent 28%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #fbfcfb 0%, var(--surface) 40%, #f4f7f6 100%);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }

  .decision-app {
    min-height: 100svh;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    padding: 0 1rem calc(6.5rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
  }

  .app-main,
  .bottom-shell {
    width: min(100%, 52rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .app-main {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 9vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .screen {
    animation: rise 420ms var(--ease-calm);
  }

  .hero-mark {
    width: 5rem;
    height: 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 18%, transparent);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 10vw, 4.8rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 8vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
  }

  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 34rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 4vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .supporting-intro {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 32rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .example-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .hero-panel,
  .question-panel,
  .summary-panel {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: var(--surface-low);
  }

  .supporting-copy,
  .summary-note {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .screen-intro {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .question-panel,
  .summary-panel {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 1.3rem;
  }

  .question-panel.question-panel-input {
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  .editorial-input {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .input-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: color 320ms var(--ease-calm);
  }

  .editorial-input:focus-within .input-label {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .editorial-input-surface {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: #eaefee;
    transition:
      background-color 320ms var(--ease-calm),
      box-shadow 320ms var(--ease-calm),
      transform 320ms var(--ease-calm);
  }

  .editorial-input:focus-within .editorial-input-surface {
    background: var(--surface-high);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgb(45 52 51 / 0.05);
  }

  .editorial-input textarea {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 10.75rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 0.85rem 0.95rem 1.1rem;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .editorial-input textarea::placeholder {
    color: #acb3b2;
  }

  .editorial-input textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
  }

  .editorial-input-accent {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 7rem;
    height: 7rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 20%, rgb(76 100 90 / 0.08));
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .option-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .option-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: inherit;
    text-align: left;
    transition:
      transform 320ms var(--ease-calm),
      background-color 320ms var(--ease-calm),
      border-color 320ms var(--ease-calm);
  }

  .option-card:hover,
  .option-card:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--outline-soft);
    background: var(--surface-bright);
  }

  .option-card.is-selected {
    background: var(--primary-container);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 34%, transparent);
  }

  .option-index {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 2.6rem;
    height: 2.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface-high);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .option-card.is-selected .option-index {
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.46);
    color: var(--primary-ink);
  }

  .option-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .option-copy strong,
  .summary-card p {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .option-copy span {
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .summary-panel {
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .summary-card {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: var(--surface-low);
  }

  .summary-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .summary-card p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .summary-note {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.25rem 0;
  }

  .summary-question {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .bottom-bar {
    position: fixed;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem calc(0.9rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .bottom-shell {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--surface-ghost);
    box-shadow: 0 -8px 40px var(--surface-shadow);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .progress {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .progress-dot {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface-highest);
    transition:
      transform 280ms var(--ease-calm),
      background-color 280ms var(--ease-calm);
  }

  .progress-dot.is-active {
    transform: scale(1.25);
    background: var(--primary);
  }

  .progress-dot.is-complete {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 38%, var(--surface-highest));
  }

  .primary-action,
  .secondary-action {
    min-height: 3.5rem;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font: inherit;
    transition:
      transform 320ms var(--ease-calm),
      opacity 320ms var(--ease-calm),
      background-color 320ms var(--ease-calm);
  }

  .primary-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0 1.25rem 0 1.45rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-dim) 100%);
    color: #e5fff2;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .primary-action:disabled {
